Z||000000||Pheagey||10-25-2001||06:40 PM||||   Darn, I gatta replace both before long. Oil pan it leaking and getting oil and gunk all over the under area o f the engine, right inside the wheel well. O well gatta replace to oil filter anyways. Also the valve cover has a few slow leaks in it between it and the block. Eats about a quart a month.<BR>   I would like recommandation on the bets seals and proceedures to do these repairs. mind you have ahave no garage but I beleive neither of these require that (outside of a torch wrench, jack stands, and some elbo greas).<BR>   O, and what do you all beleive to be the best oil/addativs for the Fiero ('88 coupe).<BR>Thanks...<P>------------------<BR>Pheagey Grean<BR>"The time to talk is over. The time for diplomacy is over, the time for bluffing is over. The time to kick some f!@king as$ is now."<P>'88 coupe 'Hotwheels'<P>Http://www.LithiumEffects.com/car.html<P>Kills: '97 Civic Auto,<BR>Killed by: -||||reg||1
